    "description": {
      "value": "<div data-ft-phase5-vocab-scrub=\"v1\" style=\"display:none\"></div>\n<p><strong>Negotiated Advantage.</strong> You can derail a hostile act mid-motion with a word, a look, or a sudden reframing.</p><ul><li>When a creature you can see within 6 squares makes an attack roll or attribute check against you or an ally, you can use your reaction to impose roll 3d10 keep lowest 2 on that roll, as you disrupt the moment with a sharp interjection.</li><li>You can use this feature a number of times per Soma Break equal to your Presence value (minimum once).</li></ul>",
